# Tabs

:::tabs[Install it](group=pm)

## npm

Use *npm*:

```sh
npm install mdsvex
```

## pnpm

Use `pnpm`:

```sh
pnpm add mdsvex
```

## yarn v{version}

```sh
yarn add mdsvex
```

:::

